{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deliver","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"destinations","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination","text":"Destination","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"..., ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batchBufferLimit","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 100) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsynchronousUnitOfWork","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsynchronousUnitOfWorkP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<()>\n","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"destinations","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Where each batch goes."}]}]},{"name":"batchBufferLimit","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"How many batches each destination may have waiting while it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still receiving an earlier one."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A unit of work that completes once the last batch is delivered, and throws what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the sequence throws, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CancellationError"},{"type":"text","text":" when cancelled."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"code":["let delivery = tracker.records","    .batch(strategy: .count(20))","    .deliver(to: ConsoleDestination(), vendor)","try await delivery.execute()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each destination receives its batches in order, one at a time, from a buffer of its own,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so a slow destination delays only itself. When a batch arrives while a destination’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"buffer already holds "},{"code":"batchBufferLimit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" batches, the oldest waiting batch is dropped."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Once the sequence ends, the work completes after every destination has received its last"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"batch."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Records a store keeps (those with an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EventRecord.deliveryTag"},{"type":"text","text":") are reported to it:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before a batch goes to any destination, and again once every destination’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"receive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has returned for it without being cancelled, when the store may forget them. A record"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the store couldn’t mark as being delivered is left out of the batch, and a batch left"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with no records isn’t sent."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Records the delivery has read but not delivered are lost to this run when it is cancelled"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or fails, and so are batches a destination’s full buffer dropped. Without a store they are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gone; a store never had them acknowledged, so it delivers them on the next launch (unless"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its bound drops them first, which it reports)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing runs until the work is executed, and each execution reads the sequence again, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a delivery that finished or failed can be executed again (a retry). Cancelling it drops"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the batches its destinations had waiting, and is permanent, as for every Afluent unit of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"work: executing a cancelled delivery again throws "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CancellationError"},{"type":"text","text":" at once, so build a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"new one instead."}]},{"name":"Precondition","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"batchBufferLimit"},{"text":" is at least 1.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/_Concurrency\/AsyncSequence\/deliver(to:batchBufferLimit:)"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/_concurrency\/asyncsequence\/deliver(to:batchbufferlimit:)"]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[EventRecord]"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"modules":[{"name":"Destinations","relatedModules":["_Concurrency"]}],"extendedModule":"_Concurrency","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:Sci12Destinationss8SendableRzSay6Events11EventRecordVG7ElementRtzrlE7deliver2to16batchBufferLimitQrAA11Destination_pd_SitF","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Deliver.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/Deliver.swift#L46"},"title":"deliver(to:batchBufferLimit:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"deliver"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","text":"Destination"},{"kind":"text","text":"..., "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"batchBufferLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsynchronousUnitOfWorkP","text":"AsynchronousUnitOfWork"},{"kind":"text","text":"<()>\n"}],"symbolKind":"method"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The work of delivering each batch of this sequence to every destination, until the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence ends."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/_Concurrency","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/_Concurrency\/AsyncSequence"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations":{"url":"\/documentation\/destinations","abstract":[],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","type":"topic","title":"Destinations","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/_Concurrency":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/_concurrency","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/_Concurrency","type":"topic","t